        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1582-626, 8 Inch Padlocking Slide Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 8\" padlocking surface mounted door bolts are made of steel  with a Brushed Chrome finish.  Can be locked with a 5/16\" diameter shackle  or smaller padlock. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1582-626_size.gif?v=1704354558\" width=\"580\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1582-626 padlock slide bolt size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-stainless-steel-padlocking-slide-bolt-don-jo-1582-630\"><b>Stainless Steel Padlocking Slide Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 1582-626 Padlocking Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection at Knob: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Padlock Hole Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Strike Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Strike Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rim Angle Strike Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rim Angle Strike Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li><b>Brushed Chrome Finish</b></li>\r\n<li>UL Rated</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1582-626.pdf?v=1704262273\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1582-626 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with mortise strike plate, rim angle strike plate, new guides, and mounting screws. (*Padlock Not Included). Use <a href=\"/products/schlage-kryptonite-padlock-with-5-16-diameter-shackle\"><b>Schlage Kryptonite Padlock with 5/16 Diameter Shackle</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/medium-duty-brass-padlock-with-5-16-shackle-mul-t-lock-g47g1\"><b>Mul-T-Lock Medium Duty Padlock with 5/16 Diameter Shackle</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. </i>\r\n</p>",
